### listar cliente
GET http://localhost:3000/clientes

### consultar cliente
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente/1

### buscar cliente por nome 
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente/buscarNome/Ana

### apagar cliente
DELETE http://localhost:3000/cliente/2

### atualizar cliente
PUT http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Paula",
    "email": "paula@gmail.com",
    "senha": "123",
    "cpf": "12345678912",
    "endereco": "Rua 300",
    "telefone": "41992223479"
}

